#: 6c929d5c0d864fbd8428d7a2deb4ca80
msgid "SERIAL4 -> UART4 (User) (TX DMA capable)"
msgstr "SERIAL4 -> UART4（用户）（TX 支持 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:68
#: 24eb187a43bf4b908171dd53357f839d
msgid ""
"SERIAL5 -> UART5 (DisplayPort, available on DJI air unit connector) (TX DMA "
"capable)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART5（DisplayPort，可通过 DJI air unit 连接器使用）（TX 支持 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:69
#: 77316c74c4c14a8c8ac6d3cde2f8796f
msgid "SERIAL6 -> UART6 (tied to internal wireless module, MAVLink2 telem)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> UART6（连接到内置无线模块，MAVLink2 数传）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:72
#: ce98cc90d3bf4f58afd47ca0c4f729a4
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:74
#: 8d61882a527141f68a125b1448a9e44f
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the SBUS pin (inverted and sent to UART2_RX). It "
"supports all RC protocols except serial protocols such as CRSF, ELRS, etc. "
"Those devices can be connected to USART1 TX and RX, instead setting "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 23."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 SBUS 引脚上（反向后发送到 UART2_RX）。支持除串行协议（如 CRSF、ELRS 等）以外的所有 RC "
"协议。这些设备可以连接到 USART1 TX 和 RX，并将 :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = "
"23。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:77
#: 5f31439103a845d7bd1c3257331a7f05
msgid ""
"Fport can be connected to USART1 TX also, but will require an external bi-"
"directional inverter and the :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 4 "
"(HalfDuplex) set."
msgstr ""
"Fport 也可以连接到 USART1 TX，但需要外部双向反向器，并设置 "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` = 4（半双工）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:80
#: c6a239e3ddb040418f83b8c58e4310d5
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:82
#: 6fd295324103457eb4f346c6a641c4c8
msgid ""
"The LongBowF405WING supports using its internal OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 "
"(MAX7456 driver). External OSD support such DisplayPor is setup by default "
"using UART5. Simultaneous use of the internal OSD and Displayport is "
"allowed. See :ref:`common-msp-osd-overview-4.2` for more info."
msgstr ""
"LongBowF405WING 支持使用其内置 OSD，采用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）。外部 OSD 支持（如 "
"DisplayPort）默认通过 UART5 设置。支持同时使用内置 OSD 和 DisplayPort。详见 :ref:`common-msp-"
"osd-overview-4.2`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:85
#: 57faa18eb13746c598c18f703b80d108
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:87
#: e9690b31f287463ea77d8b38c7551930
msgid ""
"The LongBowF405WING supports up to 12 PWM outputs . All outputs support "
"DShot."
msgstr "LongBowF405WING 支持最多 12 路 PWM 输出。所有输出均支持 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:90
#: eb58a5a840f84957af14e16ab5bdc51d
msgid "The PWM is in 5 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 5 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:93
#: 0fb8fc1648ca4422b664f8745e53a8d9
msgid "PWM 1,2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 在第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:94
#: 84fbc308f4624537a0341ec66a6fad91
msgid "PWM 3,4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 在第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:95
#: 42332c83669948878629ebd38626d145
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 在第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:96
#: dd7bbb7e968d42b5b818b60a227a25ae
msgid "PWM 7-9 in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7-9 在第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:97
#: 96164e6184e940f0882e9939a6b9624b
msgid "PWM 10-12 in group5"
msgstr "PWM 10-12 在第 5 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:99
#: 7093deef951c4a5cb0eb0d260a18a038
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in that group would need to "
"use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道需要使用相同的输出频率。如果组内任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道都需要使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:104
#: a5fcebf541c54841a5d724bb14b51a28
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:106
#: f8d3d53f05cd492693a315459739dbcf
msgid ""
"The board has a built-in voltage sensor and current sensor. The current "
"sensor can read up to 120A continuosly, 160 Amps peak. The voltage sensor "
"can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该板内置电压传感器和电流传感器。电流传感器可持续读取最大 120A，峰值 160A。电压传感器支持最高 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:110
#: 288cf372825d4b7b9b01960d066b5412
msgid "The correct battery setting parameters are set by default and are:"
msgstr "正确的电池设置参数已默认设置，参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:112
#: 5fba36d11b114331b1d6b429034a464b
msgid "Enable Battery monitor."
msgstr "启用电池监测。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:114
#: c9f1cff9170449328f6fee27fed1e54d
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` =4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` =4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:116
#: 6a33920f76db48ff9a432ce6547b2876
msgid "Then reboot."
msgstr "然后重启。"

