msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:120
#: a5e667f535fb4a5387b2b9664f23e23f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:122
#: 51c6bfad41d64b8b853834e4c95c543d
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.0"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 11.0"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:124
#: 9242dbf437b647148c3088c388a1cc5f
msgid ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 50"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` 50"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:127
#: 49a13a3e4ea74a38b13507fa2b8c616c
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:129
#: 83b423c27105451faac5622d1245748f
msgid ""
"The LongBowF405WING does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "LongBowF405WING 没有内置罗盘，但可以通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘上的 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:132
#: bf1eda1b915e48ea94670e57cdc57e0b
msgid "VTX power control"
msgstr "图传电源控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:134
#: 52d4870b1cdd49c287ed4175783039a4
msgid ""
"GPIO 81 controls the VTX BEC output to pins marked \"9V\" and \"Vs1\". "
"Setting a RELAY function to this pin and turning it \"ON\" will remove the "
"supply from these pins."
msgstr ""
"GPIO 81 控制标记为 「9V」 和 「Vs1」 引脚的图传 BEC 输出。将继电器功能分配给此引脚，并将其设为 「开」 将切断这些引脚的供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:137
#: 3d4c226ae0534b6aafa81c8ce24e702d
msgid "Camera Switch"
msgstr "摄像头切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:139
#: 6f6868edc5da4381a60a7e3cca46187e
msgid ""
"GPIO 82 controls which camera input (CC1 or C2 is applied to the internal "
"OSD. A RELAY function can be enabled to control the switching."
msgstr "GPIO 82 控制哪路摄像头输入（CC1 或 C2）连接到内置 OSD。可启用继电器功能来控制切换。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:142
#: eb2dc577163e48f98a06b521a4b8f443
msgid "Buzzer"
msgstr "蜂鸣器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:144
#: 6b667b2a9761450b8ca6607d575c3e9d
msgid "An active buzzer output is provided and is controlled as GPIO 80"
msgstr "提供有源蜂鸣器输出，由 GPIO 80 控制"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:147
#: 4703363522c04d26a7b085c0edf09c74
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:149
#: b9f054dde3994bf8994ea22a032d04d6
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found at https://firmware.ardupilot.org in "
"sub-folders labeled LongBowF405WING."
msgstr "这些飞控板的固件可在 https://firmware.ardupilot.org 的 LongBowF405WING 子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:152
#: ec54130b021140e7ab34606b1057fad8
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "烧录固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:154
#: d957977c5fbd4957972ac7a6e72d623c
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the boot "
"button pressed. Then you should load the \"LongBowF405WING_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"初次固件烧录可通过按住 boot 按钮插入 USB 来进入 DFU 模式，然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 烧录工具烧录 "
"「LongBowF405WING_bl.hex」 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-longbowf405wing.rst:158
#: 02ab1efcde4942819efdd33fbaa8bfd1
msgid "Subsequently, you can update firmware with Mission Planner."
msgstr "之后，可以使用 Mission Planner 更新固件。"
